Adds a menu bar along the top and a `Menu` type that tracks the selected item.

- `Menu::select_next` and `Menu::select_prev` move the highlight
- `Menu::activate` returns the action for the highlighted item
- The bar itself is a plain `Line`, so it picks up the active theme
